<div class="instructions experiment-methods">
	<p>This section provides a place for you to fill out the methodology associated with your experiment. This section will likely evolve as you finalize the design of your experiment.</p>
	<p>If your methodology changes throughout your experiment, we encourage you to keep methods for all data that was collected and be clear what data was collected with what protocol. Also describe why you changed the protocol.</p>
	<p>This section will be really helpful for you when you get to the stage of publishing your results! It pays to be detailed and keep this section up to date!</p>
</div>
